{"id":"e55ac759-d52b-4725-9c5f-5a7f834066f0","object":"chat.completion","created":1785034612,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n\"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    nodes = case['nodes']\\n    core = case['core_distance']\\n    distances = case['distances']\\n    \\n    # Build edge list with mutual reachability\\n    edges = []\\n    for a, b, d in distances:\\n        w = max(core[a], core[b], d)\\n        # canonical order for tie-breaking\\n        if a > b:\\n            a, b = b, a\\n        edges.append((w, a, b))\\n    \\n    # sort by weight then endpoints\\n    edges.sort(key=lambda x: (x[0], x[1], x[2]))\\n    \\n    # union-find\\n    parent = {node: node for node in nodes}\\n    rank = {node: 0 for node in nodes}\\n    \\n    def find(x):\\n        while parent[x] != x:\\n            parent[x] = parent[parent[x]]\\n            x = parent[x]\\n        return x\\n    \\n    def union(x, y):\\n        rx, ry = find(x), find(y)\\n        if rx == ry:\\n            return\\n        if rank[rx] < rank[ry]:\\n            parent[rx] = ry\\n        elif rank[rx] > rank[ry]:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n        else:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n            rank[rx] += 1\\n    \\n    mst_edges = []\\n    total_weight = 0.0\\n    for w, a, b in edges:\\n        if find(a) != find(b):\\n            union(a, b)\\n            mst_edges.append([a, b, w])\\n            total_weight += w\\n            if len(mst_edges) == len(nodes) - 1:\\n                break\\n    \\n    return {\\n        'mst_edges': mst_edges,\\n        'total_weight': total_weight\\n    }\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to produce a Python implementation of solve(case) that computes MST for mutual reachability distances. The input case has nodes, core_distance dict, distances list of triples (node1, node2, distance). Need to compute mutual reachability as max(core[node1], core[node2], given distance). Then sort edges by w