ce, distances from case.\n2. Build list of edges: for each triple (a, b, dist), get core_a, core_b from core_distance dict. Compute w = max(core_a, core_b, dist). Canonicalize: if a > b, swap.\n3. Append (w, a, b) to edges list.\n4. Sort edges by (w, a, b).\n5. Initialize union-find: parent dict, rank dict.\n6. mst_edges = [], total_weight = 0\n7. For (w, a, b) in sorted_edges:\n   if find(a) != find(b):\n       union(a, b)\n       mst_edges.append([a, b, w])\n       total_weight += w\n       if len(mst_edges) == len(nodes) - 1: break\n8. Return {\"mst_edges\": mst_edges, \"total_weight\": total_weight}\n\nUnion-find functions defined inside solve.\n\nThat's it.\n\nNow write the JSON output.\n\nMake sure the implementation string is valid Python.\n\nI'll produce the answer now."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1906,"completion_tokens":1190,"total_tokens":3096,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1792},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":737},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1792,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":114},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}